{"term": {"label": "親", "occurrences": 6, "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "5A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/wan-zhang-i", "title": "萬章上", "description": "萬章問曰：「舜往于田，號泣于旻天，何為其號泣也？」\n孟子曰：「怨慕也。」\n萬章曰：「父母愛之，喜而不忘；父母惡之，勞而不怨。然則舜怨乎？」\n曰：「長息問於公明高曰：『舜往于田，則吾既得聞命矣；號泣于旻天，于父母，則吾不知也。』公明高曰：『是非爾所知也。』夫公明高以孝子之心，為不若是恝，我竭力耕田，共為子職而已矣，父母之"}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "下", "id": "下"}, {"form": "大", "id": "大"}, {"form": "子", "id": "子"}, {"form": "孝", "id": "孝"}, {"form": "富", "id": "富"}, {"form": "愛", "id": "愛"}, {"form": "欲", "id": "欲"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "瞽瞍", "id": "瞽瞍"}, {"form": "秦", "id": "秦"}, {"form": "至", "id": "至"}, {"form": "莫", "id": "莫"}, {"form": "見", "id": "見"}, {"form": "親", "id": "親"}, {"form": "貴", "id": "貴"}, {"form": "養", "id": "養"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.2966822024302034, "source": "孝", "target": "子"}, {"weight": 2.772588722239781, "source": "孝", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 2.2129729343043585, "source": "孝", "target": "至"}, {"weight": 2.0794415416798357, "source": "孝", "target": "莫"}, {"weight": 2.367123614131617, "source": "孝", "target": "親"}, {"weight": 2.6548056865833978, "source": "愛", "target": "親"}, {"weight": 2.1439800628174073, "source": "愛", "target": "富"}, {"weight": 1.807507826196194, "source": "愛", "target": "欲"}, {"weight": 1.8562979903656263, "source": "見", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 1.9898293829901488, "source": "見", "target": "欲"}, {"weight": 3.5302744239372976, "source": "見", "target": "瞽瞍"}, {"weight": 2.1439800628174073, "source": "見", "target": "親"}, {"weight": 2.367123614131617, "source": "養", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 1.519825753744413, "source": "養", "target": "下"}, {"weight": 2.0794415416798357, "source": "養", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 2.906120114864304, "source": "養", "target": "至"}, {"weight": 2.0794415416798357, "source": "養", "target": "莫"}, {"weight": 2.367123614131617, "source": "養", "target": "親"}, {"weight": 2.772588722239781, "source": "養", "target": "秦"